// Windows resources of the editor and its test runner.
// The manifest: 1 = CREATEPROCESS_MANIFEST_RESOURCE_ID, 24 = RT_MANIFEST.
1 24 "deki-editor.manifest"
// The app icon, the Deki icon (deki-brand's app-icon/deki-app-icon.ico, 16 to
// 256 px). Explorer and the taskbar show it, and SDL gives it to the editor's
// windows.
1 ICON "deki.ico"
